The debate has been going for years on TikTok, in salon chairs, and in every press-on order that ends with second thoughts. <strong>Coffin nails vs almond nails</strong>, and after reading five articles that somehow all reach the same non-answer, you are still sitting with the same question. This post works differently. By the time you reach the decision framework at the end, you will have a clear answer based on your actual hands, your actual lifestyle, and the designs you actually want to wear. For a full deep-dive on the coffin side, <a href='/blog/coffin-nails/coffin-nails-guide'>our complete coffin nails guide covers everything</a>. But here, the focus is the choice. The difference between these two shapes is more specific than most articles admit, and once you understand it, the decision tends to make itself. <strong>Coffin nails vs almond nails</strong> decoded. Properly this time.

