## The Shape You Pick Says Less Than You Think

Most people who try both shapes and land on one do not look back. Not because it was always the right answer, but because they finally stopped second-guessing and committed. Almond is the safer choice for more hands, more lengths, and more daily contexts. Coffin is the bolder choice, and bold is sometimes exactly right. The modern almond is for everyone who looked at both and wanted something that lives between them, which in 2026 turns out to be most people. Pick the shape. Book the set. You can always switch, but you probably will not want to once the right one is on.
